  memo: "Hey @michael561, I've been a core developer on Hive for five years now, working on features that are now powering the chain and improving user experience such as RC delegations, recurrent transfers, and new community features. I recently finished tooling to facilitate an integration with Coinbase. I'm also hosting the monthly core dev meeting. I would like to carry on working for Hive for a sixth year. I thank you for your support on the previous proposal and hope I can earn your vote again, as my current proposal will expire soon. Could you review my new proposal and consider voting for it if you find it worthy of your support? https://peakd.com/me/proposals/344 Thanks a lot!"
